    <string name="conn_http_internet_warning">This address is on the internet and the connection is plain HTTP: your password and pictures can be read on the way. Use HTTPS, or the remote profile with the WireGuard tunnel.</string>
    <string name="conn_remote_title">Remote access (optional)</string>
    <string name="conn_remote_intro">To watch away from home: the receiver\'s DynDNS name or public address and the ports your router forwards to it. Leave empty if you only watch at home.</string>
