    <string name="conn_wg_title">WireGuard tunnel (experimental)</string>
    <string name="conn_wg_intro">EnigmaCast can start its own WireGuard tunnel to your home network when the receiver does not answer on the home address. The tunnel only carries EnigmaCast\'s traffic and encrypts the streams too. Experimental: it has not been tried on every TV. The official WireGuard app is the more robust choice; with that app running, leave this off and use the home address.</string>
